---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../content/site';
import { identityGraphSchema, faqSchema } from '../core/schema';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title={`${site.name} | Écrivain`} description={site.description} schema={[identityGraphSchema(), faqSchema()]}>
  <section class="hero section" id="inicio">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Nîmes · France</p>
        <h1>Pierre<br/>Menard</h1>
        <p class="kicker">Écrivain</p>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <p class="lead">Autor de <em>Don Quijote de la Mancha</em>.</p>
        <p class="intro">Una obra escrita tres siglos después de Cervantes.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="#obra">Découvrir l'œuvre →</a>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait-frame">
        <img class="portrait" src={site.author.photo} alt={`Retrato de ${site.name}`} width="700" height="820" />
        <figcaption>PIERRE MENARD · PORTRAIT</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section author-section" id="autor">
    <div class="container editorial-grid">
      <div><p class="folio">I</p><p class="eyebrow">L'Auteur</p><h2>El autor</h2></div>
      <div><p class="drop lead">{site.author.longBio}</p><p>Su escritura parte de una convicción incómoda: las palabras pueden permanecer idénticas y, sin embargo, convertirse en otra obra cuando cambia quien las escribe y el tiempo desde el que son leídas.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section book-section" id="obra">
    <div class="container book-grid">
      <figure class="book-photo">
        <img src={site.featuredBook.cover} alt={`Ejemplar de ${site.featuredBook.title}`} width="900" height="700" />
        <figcaption>UN EXEMPLAIRE SUR LA TABLE DE TRAVAIL</figcaption>
        <a class="acquire-button" href="/pierre-menard-web/acquisition/">Adquirir un ejemplar</a>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p class="folio">II</p><p class="eyebrow">L'Œuvre</p>
        <h2>{site.featuredBook.title}</h2>
        <p class="book-subtitle">{site.featuredBook.subtitle}</p>
        <p class="lead">{site.featuredBook.synopsis}</p>
        <div class="chapters"><span>IX</span><span>XXXVIII</span><span>XXII <small>fragment</small></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="critical-note" aria-label="Nota crítica sobre la obra">
    <div class="container critical-note-inner">
      <span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
      <blockquote>
        <p>Esa obra, tal vez la más significativa de nuestro tiempo.</p>
        <footer>— De una nota crítica sobre la obra de Pierre Menard</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section reading" id="leer">
    <div class="container reading-inner">
      <p class="folio">III</p><p class="eyebrow">Lire</p><h2>Una misma frase.<br/>Otra escritura.</h2>
      <p class="lead">El proyecto de Menard no busca reproducir un libro antiguo. Busca llegar a sus palabras desde una vida distinta. Allí comienza la lectura.</p>
      <blockquote class="reading-fragment">
        <p>Leo una línea conocida y la encuentro intacta. No ha cambiado una palabra; ha cambiado el mundo que la conduce hasta mí. La tinta repite la forma, pero no la experiencia. Entre Cervantes y esta página hay tres siglos, y esos tres siglos también escriben.</p>
      </blockquote>
      <div class="ornament">✦</div>
      <p class="note">Fragmento del cuaderno de trabajo</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section correspondence" id="contacto">
    <div class="container editorial-grid">
      <div><p class="folio">IV</p><p class="eyebrow">Correspondance</p><h2>Correspondencia con el señor Menard</h2></div>
      <div><p class="lead">Para lectores, editores e instituciones interesados en la obra y en la conversación literaria alrededor de ella.</p><a class="email-link" href={`${base}correspondencia/`}>Correspondance</a><address class="postal">Monsieur Pierre Menard<br/>8, rue de l’Horloge<br/>30000 Nîmes · France</address></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.hero{padding-top:clamp(3rem,7vw,7rem);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}
.hero-grid{display:grid;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,7rem);align-items:center}
h1{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.025em}.kicker{font-style:italic;font-size:1.2rem;margin:.8rem 0}.rule{width:70px;border-top:2px solid var(--color-accent);margin:2rem 0}
.intro{font-size:1rem;max-width:38ch}.text-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.6rem;color:var(--color-accent);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:.78rem;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor}
.portrait-frame,.book-photo{margin:0}.portrait{width:100%;max-height:680px;object-fit:cover;filter:sepia(.18) contrast(.96);border:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:8px;background:#d8ccb7}
figcaption{margin-top:.65rem;font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.13em;color:var(--color-muted)}
.acquire-button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:min(100%,320px);box-sizing:border-box;margin:1.35rem auto 0;padding:.9rem 1.35rem;border:1px solid #7b302d;outline:1px solid rgba(123,48,45,.28);outline-offset:3px;background:#7b302d;color:#f4ead6;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.055em;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(244,234,214,.25),0 2px 4px rgba(46,32,22,.16)}.acquire-button::before,.acquire-button::after{content:"◆";font-size:.42rem;margin:0 .75rem;color:#d6b779}.acquire-button:hover,.acquire-button:focus-visible{background:#642421;color:#fff7e8}.acquire-button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
.author-section,.correspondence{background-color:var(--color-surface);background-image:url('../assets/paper-grain.png');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:256px 256px}.editorial-grid,.book-grid{display:grid;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);align-items:start}.folio{font-style:italic;color:var(--color-accent);margin:0 0 1rem}
.drop:first-letter{float:left;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:4.5rem;line-height:.72;padding:.18rem .5rem 0 0;color:var(--color-accent)}
.book-section{border-block:1px solid var(--color-border)}.book-photo img{width:100%;max-height:650px;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:8px;background:#d8ccb7}
.book-subtitle{font-style:italic;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--color-muted)}.chapters{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.5rem}.chapters small{font-size:.65rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
.critical-note{padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);text-align:center}.critical-note-inner{max-width:850px}.quote-mark{display:block;height:.7em;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:5rem;line-height:1;color:var(--color-accent);opacity:.75}.critical-note blockquote{margin:0}.critical-note blockquote p{max-width:22ch;margin:0 auto;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:1.18;font-style:italic;text-wrap:balance}.critical-note blockquote footer{margin-top:1.5rem;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-muted)}
.email-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;color:var(--color-accent);text-underline-offset:.22em}.postal{margin-top:1.6rem;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.7;font-style:normal}.reading{text-align:center}.reading-inner{max-width:800px}.reading .lead{margin-inline:auto}.reading-fragment{max-width:620px;margin:2.5rem auto 0;padding:2rem clamp(1.25rem,4vw,3rem);border-block:1px solid var(--color-border);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.45rem);line-height:1.7;font-style:italic}.reading-fragment p{margin:0}.ornament{color:var(--color-accent);margin:2rem}.note,.small{font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-muted)}
@media(min-width:850px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr}.editorial-grid{grid-template-columns:.72fr 1.28fr}.book-grid{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr}}
</style>
